---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

export const prerender = true;
---

<Layout
  title="Terms & Conditions | Paranjape Blue Ridge Hinjewadi"
  description="Terms and Conditions governing the use of the Paranjape Blue Ridge residential township informational and advisory portal."
  pathname="/terms"
>
  <main class="pt-28 pb-20 bg-[#FAF9F6] text-[#070D1A]">
    <div class="container mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6">
      
      <div class="mb-10 border-b border-slate-200 pb-6">
        <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 text-xs font-mono text-[#785415] uppercase tracking-widest font-bold mb-4">
          Terms of Service & Usage
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-serif font-bold text-[#070D1A] tracking-tight mb-3">
          Terms & Conditions
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-mono text-slate-500">
          Last Updated: September 2026 • Paranjape Blue Ridge Portal
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none text-slate-700 space-y-8 font-sans leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
        
        <section class="bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-xs space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-[#070D1A]">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
          <p>
            By accessing or using <strong>paranjapeblueridge.com</strong>, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to be legally bound by these Terms and Conditions. If you do not accept these terms, please refrain from utilizing the portal.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-xs space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-[#070D1A]">2. Informational & Advisory Nature</h2>
          <p>
            This website serves as an informational showcase, transaction facilitation, and customer advisory portal for the 138-acre Paranjape Blue Ridge township located in Hinjewadi Phase 1, Pune.
          </p>
          <p>
            All architectural layouts, floor plans, specifications, dimensions, amenities, and computer-generated renders shown on this portal are indicative and represent conceptual designs. The final specifications, carpet areas, and fixtures shall strictly adhere to the registered MahaRERA agreements and sanction plans executed between the purchaser and the developer, Paranjape Schemes (Construction) Ltd.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-xs space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-[#070D1A]">3. Pricing & Availability</h2>
          <p>
            Prices quoted (e.g., "starting from ₹97.60 L*") are indicative base prices and do not incorporate statutory taxes, GST, stamp duty, registration charges, floor rise premiums, or infrastructure charges. Official cost sheets and unit inventory status are provided during direct consultation with authorized relationship managers.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-xs space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-[#070D1A]">4. MahaRERA Certifications</h2>
          <p>The projects showcased herein are registered under the Real Estate Regulatory Authority of Maharashtra:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 font-mono text-xs text-slate-800">
            <li><strong>Promenade Residences:</strong> MahaRERA Registration No. P52100055581</li>
            <li><strong>The Altius:</strong> MahaRERA Registration No. P52100078116</li>
            <li><strong>The Ridges 41:</strong> MahaRERA Registration No. P52100000054</li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            Detailed project information is available for public inspection on the official MahaRERA website: <a href="https://maharera.maharerait.gov.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#785415] underline font-bold">maharera.maharerait.gov.in</a>.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-xs space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-[#070D1A]">5. Intellectual Property</h2>
          <p>
            All logos, trademarks, visual media, brand insignia, architectural renderings, and editorial articles displayed on this portal are the intellectual property of their respective owners, including Paranjape Schemes (Construction) Ltd. and authorized associates. Unauthorized scraping, reproduction, or commercial repurposing without prior written authorization is strictly prohibited.
          </p>
        </section>

      </div>

      <div class="mt-12 text-center">
        <a href="/" class="btn-champagne px-8 py-3.5 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest no-underline inline-block shadow-sm">
          &larr; Return to Blue Ridge Home
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
